+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Cancellation
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Confirm `add-rental-service` is implemented (`createRentalService`, `book`, booking records with start and total); if not, stop and do that first
+- [ ] 1.2 Store a `cancelled` flag on booking records and make the shared overlap check (and `availability`, if present) ignore cancelled bookings; verify with tests that a cancelled booking's period can be rebooked and uncancelled bookings still block
+- [ ] 1.3 Implement `cancel(bookingId, at)` in `src/rental.ts` with strict `at` parsing, the 24-hour refund rule and the cancel-once check, returning `{ bookingId, refund }`; verify with tests for full refund, exactly 24 h, 1 ms inside 24 h, after start, discounted/hourly totals, unknown id, invalid `at`, second cancel throwing, and a failed cancel changing nothing
+- [ ] 1.4 Reword the "Cancellation policy data" requirement of `rentals` (it says no cancel operation exists) so it no longer contradicts `cancel`; verify with `openspec validate add-booking-cancellation`
+
+## 2. Docs
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Add a cancellation example to the `README.md` usage section and verify it matches the tested behavior
